###
### Agnostic suppression of a model's built-in (#[Validate] attribute) validators.
### Per MODEL class (not per action). Works for any controller, no trait required.
###
#plugin.tx_pxvalidation.settings {
#    suppressBaseValidation {
#        Vendor\ExtensionName\Domain\Model\Foo = 1
#    }
#}

###
### Schema (structured TypoScript notation, TYPO3 v14+)
